WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[Instrumental Intro: Catchy Driving 16-Bit Synth Arpeggio]

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.700
The living room was quiet, the carpet soft and worn

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:32.500
Just staring at the CRT before the storm was born

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:41.200
A flash of blinding purple, a crackle in the air

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.750
The glass just opened up and swallowed us in there

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.650
Static and pixels, falling through the screen

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:57.200
Into a digital nightmare, a twisted glowing dream

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.000
The smell of burning ozone, the heavy basement air

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.300
I'm holding onto you, but you're not really there

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:15.200
Oh, static and pixels!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:37.000
[Instrumental Interlude: 16-Bit Chiptune Lead & Driving Rhythm]

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:42.600
The scrying terminal's broken, wires on the floor

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:50.800
I hear the heavy footsteps coming down the corridor

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:57.300
You're reading from the parchment, a dark and cursed light

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:04.200
I've got to find a way to get us through the night

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.400
Static and pixels, falling through the screen

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.400
Into a digital nightmare, a twisted glowing dream

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.150
The smell of burning ozone, the heavy basement air

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.300
I'm holding onto you, but you're not really there

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:29.000
Oh, static and pixels!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:53.500
[Instrumental Bridge: Tension-Building 16-Bit Synth Solo]

00:02:53.850 --> 00:03:00.000
They think they can erase us, overwrite the code

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:08.500
But I've got golden magic hidden in the load

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:15.500
Just hold on to me!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:22.000
Static and pixels!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:40.500
[Outro: Anxious 16-Bit Arpeggio Fadeout]
